            "heading": "Shipping & delivery",
            "open_by_default": true,
            "open_first_question": true,
            "question_1": "How long will my order take to arrive?",
            "answer_1": "<p>For most standard orders delivered worldwide, estimated total time is about 18-25 business days: around 15-20 business days for processing and fulfillment, then about 3-5 business days in transit after shipment. Custom, made-to-order, oversized, personalized, or specially handled pieces may need more time. See the <a href='/pages/faq'>full FAQ</a> for timing details.</p>",
            "question_2": "Is shipping included, and who delivers it?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Yes. Complimentary standard shipping is included for eligible WRYDECO orders delivered worldwide, with no minimum order value required. WRYDECO works with third-party logistics partners and selected carriers, and the carrier may vary by product, destination, size, and handling needs. Read the <a href='/policies/shipping-policy'>Shipping Policy</a>.</p>",
            "question_3": "Can I change or cancel my order after placing it?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Cancellation requests may be considered only before production, preparation, or fulfillment begins. Once production, preparation, or fulfillment has begun, custom and made-to-order orders generally cannot be cancelled, changed, returned, or refunded except where required by law or where an approved damage, defect, or fulfillment issue applies. See the <a href='/pages/faq'>full FAQ</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_page_shortlist_two": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns, damage & warranty",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "open_first_question": false,
            "question_1": "Can I return or exchange a piece?",
            "answer_1": "<p>WRYDECO does not accept returns or exchanges for customer-related reasons such as change of mind, personal preference, incorrect selection, dimensions, finish, style choice, or fit. If an item arrives damaged, defective, or incorrect due to a fulfillment error and is reported within 30 calendar days of delivery, it may be reviewed under the Return & Refund Policy. For an approved eligible return or collection, WRYDECO covers the applicable return shipping costs. Read the <a href='/policies/refund-policy'>Return & Refund Policy</a>.</p>",
            "question_2": "My piece arrived damaged or incorrect. What should I do?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Contact WRYDECO within 30 calendar days of delivery with your order number, a clear issue description, photos of the item, outer and inner packaging, shipping label, and video evidence where useful. Keep the item and all packaging until WRYDECO gives written instructions. See the <a href='/policies/refund-policy'>Return & Refund Policy</a>.</p>",
            "question_3": "What warranty does WRYDECO provide?",
            "answer_3": "<p>WRYDECO provides a 1-year limited warranty across all furniture product categories, effective from the date of delivery. It covers defects in materials and workmanship and may result in repair or replacement of defective parts. It does not cover normal wear, misuse, accidents, water damage, harsh cleaners, or natural wood characteristics. See the <a href='/pages/warranty-policy'>Warranty Policy</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_page_shortlist_three": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Consultation & support",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "open_first_question": false,
            "question_1": "Can I speak to someone before I buy, and do you work with designers?",
            "answer_1": "<p>Yes. Private consultation is complimentary before you order and carries no obligation to purchase. Share room details, rough dimensions, finish direction, timeline, budget range, or references, and the team can help with custom sizing, specifications, finish matching, and project timelines. Contact WRYDECO through email, phone, or live chat, or visit the <a href='/pages/faq'>full FAQ</a>.</p>",
